                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>When is Amazon Great Indian Sale?</h3>
                                        <p>Typically late September / early October (Diwali-adjacent). 4-7 day peak window. Dates vary annually — check Amazon India calendar.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does GIS drive for Amazon D2C brands?</h3>
                                        <p>20-40% of Amazon India annual revenue in 4-7 day window. Consumer electronics + fashion + home peak higher.</p>
                                        <h3>Is GIS more important than Prime Day for India?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for India-focused brands — GIS Diwali-timed + massive Indian consumer intent. Prime Day secondary for India.</p>
                                        <h3>What is CPC inflation during GIS?</h3>
